<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<section class="section" style="padding-top: 9rem;">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <div class="section-header reveal-on-scroll">
      <span class="badge badge-cyan"><i data-lucide="eye"></i> Digital Inclusion</span>
      <h1 class="section-title">Accessibility Statement</h1>
      <p>Committed to WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility standards for all users.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-card prose reveal-on-scroll">
      <h2>Our Commitment</h2>
      <p>Beyounge Technologies Inc. is committed to ensuring digital accessibility for individuals with visual, auditory, motor, or cognitive impairments. We continuously optimize our mobile application and web layouts in alignment with Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA.</p>

      <h2>Key Accessibility Features</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>High Contrast Dark Palette:</strong> Accessible color contrast ratios exceeding 4.5:1 for all body copy and active controls.</li>
        <li><strong>Screen Reader Friendly:</strong> Semantic HTML tags, clear landmark regions, and descriptive ARIA labels across interactive components.</li>
        <li><strong>Full Keyboard Navigation:</strong> Focus indicators across buttons, accordions, and forms.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Accessibility Feedback</h2>
      <p>If you encounter accessibility barriers on our website or mobile app, please contact us at <strong>accessibility@beyounge.app</strong>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

